        "created_at": "2021-10-13T13:56:18.007Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Far from it, F.I.L.T.E.R. being an organisation that operates across multiple universes places more emphasis on threats against them than threats against an Earth.</p>\n<p>Iron Legacy is more destructive but is also unlikely to work out how to take down FILTER unless it’s a threat right in front of him whereas Wraiths skill set could detect and work out a way to act against FILTER directly.</p>",
